      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Our studies suggest that plasma soluble advanced glycation end products (sRAGEs) has significantly negative association with high sensitivity C-reactive protein (hs-CRP) in 245 type 2 diabetes patients without diagnosed coronary artery disease (CAD). sRAGE maybe act as a novel biomarker for predicting the atherosclerosis in diabetes at the early stage."},
